# Same class as the four above: the filled-in ChatGPT Apps SDK submission
# payload (app_info, per-tool annotation justifications, reviewer test cases).
# It is maintainer store-submission workflow, not product, and nothing in this
# repo reads it. Ignored rather than committed so it stops showing up as an
# untracked file in every status check.
chatgpt-app-submission.json

# Internal maintenance docs for Claude Code sessions working ON this repo
# (architecture/decision history, internal account/process context). These
# are for maintainers, not for a plugin end user, and are not referenced by
# any manifest, skill, or hook -- nothing in the shipped product reads them.
# Kept locally on developer machines (never delete), just never committed.
CLAUDE.md
MCP-ROUTING-CONTRACT.md

